A.aPB=s(["Be careful when a message or caller asks for money, a code, or a password.","Be careful when it says something is urgent, like a parcel, a fine, or a blocked bank account.","Do not tap links in such messages.","Never say or type codes from text messages. Your bank never asks for them.","If someone says they are your child with a new number, call the old number first.","When unsure, hang up and call me."],t.s)
A.a00=new B.as("Spot a scam message or call",A.R,A.aPB)
A.aNC=s(["Do not type anything more and close the page.","If you gave a card number or bank login, call your bank at once. The number is on the back of your card.","Change the password you typed, from a safe place.","Do not pay or answer anyone who calls about it afterwards.","Tell me. It happens to many people, and acting fast helps."],t.s)
A.a04=new B.as("I tapped a scam link: what now?",A.R,A.aNC)
A.aNM=s(["Tap the green WhatsApp icon.","Tap the name of the person you want to call.","Tap the camera icon at the top right.","Wait until they answer. Hold the phone in front of your face.","To end the call, tap the red button."],t.s)
A.a09=new B.as("Video call on WhatsApp",A.R,A.aNM)
A.aR6=s([u.s,"Tap the camera icon next to the message box.","Tap the photo you want to send.","Tap the green arrow to send it."],t.s)
A.a_W=new B.as("Send a photo on WhatsApp",A.R,A.aR6)
A.b0g=s([u.s,"Press and hold the microphone button at the bottom right.","Keep holding and talk.","Let go to send it.","To listen to a voice message, tap the play triangle."],t.s)
A.a06=new B.as("Send a voice message on WhatsApp",A.R,A.b0g)
A.b0N=s(["On the login page, tap Forgot password?","Type your e-mail address or phone number.","You get a code by SMS or e-mail. Type it in. Never give this code to anyone else.","Choose a new password and type it twice.","Write it in a notebook you keep at home, not on a note on the phone."],t.s)
A.a1e=new B.as("Forgot a password",A.R,A.b0N)
A.aXK=s(["Open your bank's app. Never use a link from a message or e-mail.","Type your login details only in the bank's own app.","Confirm the login in the bank app or with the code you get.","Check the amount and the name before you confirm any payment.","Your bank will never call you to ask for your PIN or codes.","When done, tap Log out."],t.s)
A.a0A=new B.as("Log in to online banking safely",A.R,A.aXK)
A.aMl=s(["Open your bank's app and log in.","The amount on the first screen is your balance.","To pay, tap Payment or Transfer.","Type or scan the account number (IBAN), the amount and a note.","Check the name and the amount carefully.","Confirm with your PIN or fingerprint."],t.s)
A.a0g=new B.as("Bank app: check your balance and pay",A.R,A.aMl)
A.aOo=s(["Open Settings. It is the grey gear icon.","Tap Display (on iPhone: Display & Brightness).","Tap Text size (on iPhone: Text Size).","Move the slider to the right until the text is easy to read."],t.s)
A.a03=new B.as("Make the text bigger",A.R,A.aOo)
A.aCT=s(["Open Settings. It is the grey gear icon.","Tap Wi-Fi (on some phones: Connections, then Wi-Fi).","Make sure Wi-Fi is switched on.","Tap the name of your home Wi-Fi.","Type the password. It is often written on the back of the router.","Tap Connect (on iPhone: Join). A small fan symbol appears at the top."],t.s)
A.a01=new B.as("Connect to Wi-Fi",A.R,A.aCT)
A.aUH=s(["Open Settings and tap Storage (on iPhone: General, then iPhone Storage).","Look at what takes the most space. Usually it is photos and videos.","Delete long videos you do not need.","Turn on photo backup (Google Photos or iCloud) so your photos are safe.","Then tap Free up space to remove the copies from the phone."],t.s)
A.a0G=new B.as("Phone is full: free up space",A.R,A.aUH)
A.b8D=s(["Hold the side button until the screen lights up.","Choose your language and connect to your home Wi-Fi.","Sign in with your Google account (on iPhone: Apple ID). Use the same one as on your old phone.","Choose to copy data from your old phone and keep both phones close together.","Wait until it is finished. Your contacts, photos and apps come over.","Check that calls, WhatsApp and photos work."],t.s)
A.a0R=new B.as("Set up a new phone",A.R,A.b8D)
A.b0d=s(["The phone rings and shows a name.","Swipe the green button to the right, or tap it.","Hold the phone to your ear and talk.","To hang up, tap the red button."],t.s)
A.a0h=new B.as("Answer a phone call",A.R,A.b0d)
A.alL=s(["Open the Phone app and tap Contacts.","Tap the + button.","Type the first name and the last name.","Tap Phone and type the number.","Tap Save (on iPhone: Done)."],t.s)
A.a0t=new B.as("Save a new contact",A.R,A.alL)
A.a2U=s(["The buttons on the side of the phone change the volume.","Press the upper button to make it louder.","Press the lower button to make it quieter.","If the phone does not ring, it may be on silent. A bell with a line through it shows this.","Press the upper button a few times until the bell is back (on iPhone: move the small switch on the side)."],t.s)
A.a0_=new B.as("Volume and silent mode",A.R,A.a2U)
A.arF=s(["Plug in the charger and connect to Wi-Fi first.","Open Settings.","Tap Software update (on iPhone: General, then Software Update).","Tap Download and install.","Wait. The phone may turn off and on again. This is normal."],t.s)
A.a_Z=new B.as("Update the phone",A.R,A.arF)
A.aAh=s(["Open Play Store (on iPhone: App Store).","Tap Search and type the name of the app.","Check the name and the maker. Fake apps look similar.","Tap Install (on iPhone: Get).","Wait. The new app appears on your home screen."],t.s)
A.a0b=new B.as("Install an app",A.R,A.aAh)
A.b_k=s(["Open the Camera app.","Point the camera at the black-and-white square code.","Hold still until a yellow link or box appears.","Tap the link to open it.","Only open codes from places you trust, like a restaurant menu."],t.s)
A.a0s=new B.as("Scan a QR code",A.R,A.b_k)
A.aMT=s(["Open the app or website of your doctor or health service.","Log in. If you forgot the password, use the Forgot password guide.","Tap Appointments or Book.","Choose the doctor, the day and the time.","Tap Confirm. Write the date on your calendar at home too."],t.s)
A.a0Z=new B.as("Book a doctor's appointment online",A.R,A.aMT)
A.a35=s(["Open the Clock app.","Tap Alarm at the bottom.","Tap the + button.","Choose the hour and the minutes.","Tap Save (on iPhone: Save at the top right).","Check that the switch next to the alarm is on."],t.s)
A.a0f=new B.as("Set an alarm",A.R,A.a35)
A.b2v=s(["Look at the battery symbol at the top of the screen.","When it is low or red, plug in the charger.","Put the small end of the cable into the phone and the plug into the wall.","A lightning symbol shows that the phone is charging.","The best time to charge is overnight, next to the bed."],t.s)
A.a0v=new B.as("Charge the phone",A.R,A.b2v)
A.b7r=s(["Open the Photos app (on some phones: Gallery).","Tap a photo to see it big.","Swipe left to see the next photo.","Put two fingers on the photo and spread them to zoom in.","Tap Back or the arrow at the top to see all photos again."],t.s)
A.a_U=new B.as("Look at your photos",A.R,A.b7r)
A.b6l=s(["Press the red power button on the TV remote.","If the screen says No signal, press the Source or Input button.","Choose TV or HDMI 1 with the arrow buttons.","Press OK.","If there is a second remote for the TV box, turn that on too."],t.s)
A.a_S=new B.as('Turn on the TV and fix "No signal"',A.cD,A.b6l)
A.b0P=s(["Turn on the TV with the remote.","Press the Home button. It often shows a little house.","Choose YouTube or Netflix with the arrow buttons and press OK.","Choose a programme and press OK to play.","Press Back to leave, or Home to go back to normal TV."],t.s)
A.a0o=new B.as("Watch YouTube or Netflix on the TV",A.cD,A.b0P)
A.aUu=s(["Press the Settings or Menu button on the remote.","Choose Accessibility or Subtitles.","Choose Subtitles and set it to On.","Press Back or Exit to watch TV again."],t.s)
A.a0r=new B.as("Turn on TV subtitles",A.cD,A.aUu)
